# Implementation Plan - Upgrade Ring of Fortune Betting Console

We will upgrade the layout of the left betting console in **Ring of Fortune** to match the new mockup: replacing the color bet input rows with a 2x2 grid of option cards, adding structured headers, and enabling instant auto-betting on clicking any option card.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **New Betting Mechanics (Auto-Bet)**:
> - Tapping any of the 4 option cards in the 2x2 grid will **instantly place a bet** of the current input amount (e.g. ₹10) on that color, automatically deducting it from the balance.
> - Clicking the same card multiple times will add multiple bets (accumulating on that card).
> - Active bet amounts will be displayed as a badge on the top-right of each option card.
> - The bottom green **Bet** button will show the total active bet placed in this round, and tapping it (if no bets are placed yet) will place a default bet on Option 1.
> - The **Reset** button will refund all placed bets in the current round back to the user's balance and reset the amount input.

> [!NOTE]
> **Layout Layout Order (Top to Bottom)**:
> 1. **2x2 Grid of Option Buttons**: Large glossy cards with custom color themes (Blue, Purple, Orange, Green), ring icons, and labels.
> 2. **SUGGEST AMOUNT Section**: Quick suggestion buttons (`+10`, `+100`, `+500`, `+1000`) with blue outline borders.
> 3. **ENTER AMOUNT Section**: Compact input bar with standard controls (`₹`, input field, `-`, `+`, `Reset`).
> 4. **Footer**: Relocated player info card and Bet status button.

